cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this replication package, please cite it."
title: "Kazakhstan Digital Knowledge Gaps: Replication Package"
type: dataset
version: "1.0.1"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.22712068"
license: "CC0-1.0"
date-released: 2026-09-11

authors:
  - family-names: "Mirmanova"
    given-names: "Sofiya"

abstract: >-
  Frozen replication package for a study of digital knowledge gaps
  related to Kazakhstan across Kazakh Wikipedia, Wikidata, and
  large-language-model benchmarks. The release contains analytical
  datasets, frozen scored AI outputs, statistical result tables,
  software-environment information, integrity hashes, and a
  reproduction notebook.

keywords:
  - Kazakhstan
  - Kazakh Wikipedia
  - Wikidata
  - knowledge gaps
  - digital inequality
  - large language models
  - reproducibility
  - Wikimedia

